    "name": "Modus Operandi",
    "repo": "https://github.com/protesilaos/modus-themes",
    "license": "CC0-1.0",
    "copyright": "Protesilaos Stavrou",
    "paletteSource": "https://protesilaos.com/emacs/modus-themes-colors",
    "notes": "Uses the original untinted palette dedicated to CC0 by its author, not the GPL theme implementation. Pure black/white reading colors, neutral surface states, named accent and nuanced status/highlight colors. Muted text and borders are strengthened for dashboard states. The 17 editor hues interpolate the named palette in OKLCH and meet 7:1 on paper. Primary button states meet 4.5:1; the application as a whole is not an audited WCAG AAA implementation."
  },
